      swz 3, zoteus 3, cfh 2, JETP 1, DOIfetch 1: land or park first, or rebase + rerun migrate)
- [ ] no GitHub remote: arena (padme, direct merge --no-ff per its CLAUDE.md); doudou: askMinh,
      fs-housekeeper, matrice-hybride, html (pushes to padme:CNRS/projets/actifs/homepage);
      no CI there, hooks mandatory
- [ ] clone sweep after each merge: doudou cadens, archiveCIRED, Fuzzy Corpus, JETP-observer,
      climate-finance-het, chemin-de-voix, padme, sen-causal-reading, search-works-for-zotero,
      DOIfetch, .agents, both aedist clones; padme ~/data/search-works-for-zotero; doudou
      git-erg clone: pull only
- Excluded: arena/workloads/*, arena/repos/*, ~/tmp-*, ~/sen-causal-reading-check

## Hazards
- padme clones of aedist-technical-report and chemin-de-voix: core.hooksPath points at dead
  pre-move paths; fix that per-clone config before their wave.
- padme PATH `erg` is old (2c490b7); doudou has none (padme session files the host ticket).
- padme swz primary checkout: ticket branch, 11 dirty files, 17 worktrees: never touch it.
- doudou codex session in sen-causal-reading: reach it by `scripts/runtime.py wake send` or ticket.
- Hundreds of advisory "displaced log entry" WARNs: expected.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] every store above has `tickets/.claims/` on its default branch with the pinned binary
- [ ] clone sweep done on both hosts; per-clone hooks installed where needed
- [ ] blockers reported to the author one at a time

